# ---------- captures and converted data (large; regenerate, don't commit) ----------
# Raw pcaps (~270 MB) and the tshark-converted captures (~450 MB) are inputs/build
# products, not source. Regenerate json_full/ from hackaton_airframe/ on the host
# with `python convert_full.py` (needs tshark). Remove these two lines if you do
# want the captures themselves versioned (e.g. via Git LFS).
hackaton_airframe/
json_full/
json/

